Rule 5 (all dimensions of the input tensor must be non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 6 (if the input tensor has dimensions, the size of the first dimension must be non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 0 then shape(v_1, 0) ≥ 0
